    <item>
      <title>AI时代的人本觉醒：MIT揭示人类无可替代的EPOCH能力与叙事力量</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aimitepoch-20250917104004879-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 10:40:04 +0800</pubDate>
